+# Chronyx Mobile update policy
+
+Package: `com.chronyx.browser.mobile`
+
+Persistent release signing begins with `0.3.0-alpha.3` (`versionCode 3`).
+
+Release certificate SHA-256:
+
+`08:E3:DF:D2:CC:CA:DD:A1:EC:1F:6E:8C:97:14:B4:76:F4:D8:98:0C:70:FC:7A:D8:20:7F:22:75:CF:41:6E:A9`
+
+All subsequent sideloaded updates must:
+
+1. keep the same applicationId;
+2. increment versionCode;
+3. be built from the current source;
+4. be signed with the same persistent Chronyx Mobile release key;
+5. pass APK signature and package-metadata verification before release.
+
+The private signing material is not stored in the public source repository.
